WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.302 --> 00:00:18.926
my young friends, the three months had almost passed.

2
00:00:20.447 --> 00:00:23.489
Aladdin's mother was shopping for a dress at the bazaar.

3
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.933
Her son's wedding to the princess would be very soon.

4
00:00:29.314 --> 00:00:31.156
Zeba wanted to look her best.

5
00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:34.913
But something very strange was happening.

6
00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:40.475
People were singing and dancing in the street.

7
00:00:40.495 --> 00:00:42.956
"What's going on?"

8
00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:44.437
Zeba wondered.

9
00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:49.259
She hurried to a vegetable stand as a merchant packed up his onions.

10
00:00:49.279 --> 00:00:51.480
"Why are you closing?"

11
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:52.600
she asked.

12
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.182
"The whole kingdom is celebrating!"

13
00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:57.082
he said.

14
00:00:57.102 --> 00:01:02.896
"Tomorrow, Princess Badra will marry Kasim, the son of the grand vizier!"

15
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:05.997
"Oh, my poor Aladdin!"

16
00:01:06.517 --> 00:01:08.518
cried Zeba, and she hurried home.

17
00:01:10.358 --> 00:01:16.360
Bursting through the front door of their house, she called out, "The sultan has broken his promise!"

18
00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.861
"What are you talking about, Mother?"

19
00:01:19.361 --> 00:01:20.101
asked Aladdin.

20
00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:25.102
"Princess Badra is to be married tomorrow," cried Zeba.

21
00:01:25.123 --> 00:01:27.303
"To the vizier's son!"

22
00:01:27.323 --> 00:01:31.504
"But she was promised to me," said Aladdin.

23
00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.665
"I must stop the wedding."

24
00:01:33.685 --> 00:01:36.787
"How?" asked Zeba.

25
00:01:36.807 --> 00:01:39.468
"Don't worry," said Aladdin.

26
00:01:39.488 --> 00:01:42.849
"Princess Badra will not marry anyone but me!"

27
00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.451
Aladdin went to his room and locked the door.

28
00:01:50.713 --> 00:01:53.594
He took the lamp from its hiding place under some cushions.

29
00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.816
He rubbed the lamp until smoke swirled around the room.

30
00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:03.370
"The genie of the wonderful lamp is back!"

31
00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.291
said the cheerful genie.

32
00:02:05.311 --> 00:02:08.633
"Your wish is my command!"

33
00:02:08.653 --> 00:02:12.094
"Oh, genie of the lamp, go to the palace!"

34
00:02:12.675 --> 00:02:13.415
ordered Aladdin.

35
00:02:13.435 --> 00:02:17.137
"When Princess Badra is alone, bring her to me."

36
00:02:17.157 --> 00:02:20.959
"I hear and obey!"

37
00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.181
said the genie and disappeared in a blink.

38
00:02:25.162 --> 00:02:29.024
An hour later, the genie returned with Princess Badra in his arms.

39
00:02:30.476 --> 00:02:31.517
"Put me down!"

40
00:02:32.057 --> 00:02:32.977
yelled the princess.

41
00:02:32.997 --> 00:02:40.761
"I hear and obey," laughed the genie and dropped her on the floor.

42
00:02:40.781 --> 00:02:45.983
"Ow!" cried the princess, rubbing her backside.

43
00:02:47.123 --> 00:02:48.924
She stood up, shaking with anger.

44
00:02:48.944 --> 00:02:50.465
"Who are you?"

45
00:02:50.485 --> 00:02:55.427
"I am the genie of the wonderful—" "Silence!"

46
00:02:55.987 --> 00:02:57.568
she cried, stamping her foot.

47
00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.621
Then she noticed Aladdin.

48
00:03:00.641 --> 00:03:02.402
"Who are you?"

49
00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.784
she asked in a softer voice.

50
00:03:04.804 --> 00:03:07.486
"I am Aladdin," he said.

51
00:03:07.506 --> 00:03:09.527
"I am going to be your husband."

52
00:03:09.547 --> 00:03:12.689
"You?" laughed the princess.

53
00:03:12.709 --> 00:03:15.011
"That's strange.

54
00:03:15.631 --> 00:03:17.933
I thought I was marrying Kasim tomorrow."

55
00:03:19.874 --> 00:03:24.617
You see, my young friends, Princess Badra did not want to marry Kasim.

56
00:03:25.858 --> 00:03:27.800
They had been children together in the palace.

57
00:03:29.036 --> 00:03:32.497
Kasim had always been lazy and mean to everyone.

58
00:03:33.577 --> 00:03:38.059
But Princess Badra saw that Aladdin was handsome and seemed kind.

59
00:03:38.079 --> 00:03:42.820
"Your father promised you to me," said Aladdin.

60
00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:48.722
"Well, my father listens too much to that awful vizier," she replied.

61
00:03:48.742 --> 00:03:52.503
"That is why I must marry his silly son."

62
00:03:52.523 --> 00:03:57.204
"Do not marry him, Princess," said Aladdin.

63
00:03:58.516 --> 00:04:00.197
"No one could ever love you as I do."

64
00:04:01.837 --> 00:04:06.660
Suddenly the princess felt the air become hot, and the room began to spin.

65
00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.702
After hearing his words of love, her heart started beating faster.

66
00:04:13.903 --> 00:04:18.304
All at once, she knew she was in love too—with Aladdin!

67
00:04:18.325 --> 00:04:20.766
"The genie will take you home.

68
00:04:22.086 --> 00:04:26.208
In the morning, tell your father that you will not marry Kasim," said Aladdin.

69
00:04:27.372 --> 00:04:28.713
"And don't tell anyone about me."

70
00:04:30.473 --> 00:04:34.295
The next morning, the palace was buzzing with wedding preparations.

71
00:04:35.455 --> 00:04:38.517
The princess's attendants tiptoed into her room early.

72
00:04:39.517 --> 00:04:42.398
But they quickly came out again with shocking news.

73
00:04:42.418 --> 00:04:45.059
"The wedding is off!"

74
00:04:45.379 --> 00:04:46.060
they shouted.

75
00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.361
Servants ran up and down the halls.

76
00:04:50.381 --> 00:04:52.502
"The wedding is off!"

77
00:04:53.783 --> 00:04:56.724
The palace guards carried messages back and forth.

78
00:04:57.204 --> 00:04:58.166
"The wedding is off!"

79
00:05:00.691 --> 00:05:07.784
The grand vizier entered the sultan's chamber and came back out screaming, "THE WEDDING IS OFF!"
